    "title": "MICROSERVICE-driftdoc-Create Hotel Rooms Hold-v1-spec",
    "description": "The Hotel Room Hold Management API facilitates the temporary holding of hotel rooms for customers. This ensures that potential guests can secure accommodation for a designated period, enhancing their booking experience. The API allows for the creation of room holds, enabling hotel operators to manage inventory effectively while catering to customer demand. Typically used by hotel reservation systems, travel agencies, and front desk staff, this API streamlines the process of securing rooms prior to final booking confirmation.",
